## The codeline: gotransit

gotransit (next.gotransit.com) is a Next.js 15 Pages Router app in TypeScript strict mode,
Node 22, React 18. package.json at the repo root is the dependency manifest and the source of
truth for commands: `npm run lint` (ESLint over src/, migration-scripts/, next.config.source.ts,
postbuild.ts, next-sitemap.config.ts), `npm run check-types` (`tsc --noEmit --incremental`),
`npm run test` (Jest) / `npm run test:coverage-check` (Jest --coverage, coverageThreshold.global
60% branches/functions/lines/statements per jest.config.js), `npm run build` (Next.js build via
esbuild-compiled next.config.source.ts). Use these verbatim; re-derive from package.json if the
codeline has since changed them rather than assume they are still current.

Source lives under src/: pages/ (Pages Router, incl. pages/api/v1/** REST routes), api/
