components/ (~150 one-per-folder components, plus components/pages/* page compositions and
components/componentMappers/* Contentstack content-type mapping), context/ (React Context
providers, one per concern, each exporting a useXContext() hook), hooks/ (use*SWR.ts
data-fetching hooks via swr, plus plain hooks), services/, utils/ (grouped by domain: ecommerce,
dates, stations, trips, fares, ...), interface/ (TS types), constants/. Tests are colocated in a
sibling __tests__/ directory next to their source using the .spec.ts/.spec.tsx suffix (never
.test.ts) — except API route tests, centralized under src/__tests__/pages/api/** mirroring the
pages/api tree. Confirm this layout against the real tree before relying on it.

