2. Judge relevance to THIS story from the surrounding comment text, not the URL alone.
3. For a relevant, fetchable link, extract only what bears on the implementation — e.g. if a linked doc specifies exact case-folding rules RFC 5321/5322 expects for email comparison, or a design doc dictating where normalization should live (client CheckoutForm.tsx vs. server Joi schema.ts) — quote it.
4. Report what you could not reach — most internal links will be unreachable; that's expected and useful.

